{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Sets a command's desc and/or groups metadata. Writes to the command's implementation record (where the dev editor's save_command keeps them); a desc already present on the command record itself is kept in sync, since read_command prefers it. Empty string leaves a field untouched. Record-level readers/writers are not modified. JOURNALED on the control's patch journal (facet \"command\", cmd = the name, op \"meta\", old/new = JSON objects holding only the desc/groups values that actually changed); re-setting the same values writes no entry. The result carries patch_id when an entry was written, or journal_warning when the edit landed but could not be journaled. label is the stated reason for the edit, recorded on the entry (the why-harvest pairs it with the change; empty is allowed and records no reason); an empty author defaults to the calling session's user, else anonymous.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"desc":"Library name.","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Control name within the library.","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Command name on the control.","name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"desc":"New command description; empty leaves the current value untouched.","name":"desc","type":"String"},{"desc":"Comma-delimited security-group string, stored verbatim; empty leaves the current value untouched.","name":"groups","type":"String"},{"desc":"The stated reason for this edit, recorded on the journal entry (the why-harvest pairs it with the change). May be empty, which records no reason.","name":"label","type":"String"},{"desc":"Who is making the edit, recorded on the journal entry. Empty defaults to the calling session's user, else anonymous.","name":"author","type":"String"},{"desc":"Request metadata filled in by the framework; pass an empty string from tools.","name":"nn_s